  "scopeRequested": "Krish, 2026-09-25: \"I find the AI brain page a little boring and uninspiring. I also feel like it's not as relatable as to why this approach is a good one (its portable, its private and belongs to the individual, and it's designed for the leaders that have high standards and unique perspectives - they can clone themselves, amplify their strengths, level out their weaknesses, and level themselves up so they can level their business up - which is why GTM falls out of Brain).\" Feedback items AI-BRAIN-NARRATIVE-001 and AI-BRAIN-VOICE-001. Approval, 2026-09-25: \"1. yes I like it. 2. You don't need to have verbal diahorrea and commentate on whose brain it is, just chill the hell out. 3. I agree with your position.\"",
